#: ../../../release-notes/changelog.rst:130
msgid ""
"Deprecate declaring the reserved keyword arguments ``body``, ``cookies``, "
"``data``, ``headers``, ``query``, ``request``, ``scope`` and ``socket`` "
"without the type listed below, or with a different one. Doing so will raise "
"a :exc:`DeprecationWarning`. Reserved keyword arguments declared without "
"their type will stop working in Litestar 3.0."
