msgid ""
"Ensure ``data`` is always documented, and ensure that ``data`` annotations "
"are compatible between dependencies and handler functions."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../release-notes/changelog.rst:233
msgid ""
"Introduce generic request body markers, following the pattern established by "
"the enhanced request parameter declarations."
