msgid ""
"Introduce :data:`params.SkipValidation <litestar.params.SkipValidation>` "
"generic. ``Dependency(skip_validation=True)`` can be cleanly migrated to "
"this. In addition, ``SkipValidation`` works on all parameters, not just "
"dependencies."
