#: ../../../release-notes/changelog.rst:299
msgid ""
"Abort requests with a ``400 - Bad Request`` if a malformed ``Host`` header "
"is sent."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../release-notes/changelog.rst:303
msgid ""
"This change was prompted by https://github.com/Kludex/starlette/security/"
"advisories/GHSA-86qp-5c8j-p5mr However, Litestar does *not* share this "
"vulnerability,  as the ``Host`` header was not used to reconstruct the URL"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../release-notes/changelog.rst:312
msgid ""
"Fix a regression introduced in ``2.22.0`` that would cause bare handler "
"parameters wrapped in ``Annotated`` and not explicitly marked with the new "
"parameter markers (:data:`~litestar.params.FromQuery` etc.) to be treated as "
"a query parameter, causing validation issues."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../release-notes/changelog.rst:321
msgid ""
"``Optional[Annotated[Literal[...], Meta(...)]]`` raised a ``KeyError`` "
"during schema generation because ``make_non_optional_union`` preserves the "
"``Annotated`` wrapper, and ``_iter_flat_literal_args`` then iterated the PEP "
"593 metadata as if it were a literal value. Wrapper annotations are now "
"stripped at the top of ``_iter_flat_literal_args`` so the function is robust "
"regardless of where it is entered from."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../release-notes/changelog.rst:333
msgid ""
"Fix a bug that would cause metadata from a ``msgspec.Meta`` placed inside an "
"``Optional`` on a ``Struct`` field - ``Optional[Annotated[T, Meta(...)]]`` - "
"to be silently dropped from the generated OpenAPI schema."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../release-notes/changelog.rst:354
msgid ""
"Deprecate ``litestar.contrib.opentelemetry`` in favour of :mod:`litestar."
"plugins.opentelemetry`. The contrib location will be removed in 3.0.0."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../release-notes/changelog.rst:363
msgid ""
"Deprecate ``litestar.repository`` and its submodules (``filters``, "
"``exceptions``, ``handlers``, ``abc``, ``testing``) in favor of "
"``advanced_alchemy``. The module will be removed before 3.0.0."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../release-notes/changelog.rst:371
msgid ""
"Deprecate ``litestar.contrib.jinja`` in favor of :mod:`litestar.plugins."
"jinja`. The contrib location will be removed in 3.0.0."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../release-notes/changelog.rst:379
msgid ""
"Deprecate ``litestar.contrib.mako`` in favor of  :mod:`litestar.plugins."
"mako`. The contrib location will be removed in 3.0.0."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../release-notes/changelog.rst:386
msgid ""
"Deprecate ``litestar.contrib.minijinja`` in favor of :mod:`litestar.plugins."
"minijinja`. The contrib location will be removed in 3.0.0."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../release-notes/changelog.rst:394
msgid ""
"Add an ``oauth2_redirect_url`` parameter to :class:`~litestar.openapi."
"plugins.SwaggerRenderPlugin`. When set, the value is emitted as "
"``oauth2RedirectUrl`` in the Swagger UI bundle config, overriding the "
"default behavior of computing the URL from the current page location. This "
"allows the OAuth2 redirect to be set explicitly when the API is mounted "
"under a sub-path."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../release-notes/changelog.rst:405
msgid ""
"Introduce a new way to declare parameters, with improved typing ergonomics. "
"These replaces / enhance the existing parameter declaration mechanics, and "
"deprecate the implicit declaration style for query and path parameters."
msgstr ""

