#: ../../../release-notes/changelog.rst:623
msgid ""
"Fix a bug in :class:`~litestar.stores.file.FileStore`, that could lead to a "
"key collision due to improper normalization."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../release-notes/changelog.rst:626
msgid ""
"``FileStore`` use a key normalization method to ensure every key passed was "
"able to be used as a valid file name on any platform. However, due to the "
"nature of unicode normalization, the approach taken resulted in the "
"possibility of uninentional key collisions, e.g. ``K`` (The Kelvin sign) "
"would normalize to a regular ASCII ``K``, so a key like ``K1234`` (with the "
"Kelvin sign) and ``K1234`` (with a regular ``K``) would result in the same "
"key."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../release-notes/changelog.rst:633
msgid ""
"This has been fixed by performing normalization on the keys via a hashing "
"function."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../release-notes/changelog.rst:656
