#: ../../../release-notes/changelog.rst:2927
msgid ""
"This can be tested over at https://editor-next.swagger.io by loading up the "
"OpenAPI 3.1 Pet store example. Then add ``examples`` in ``components.schemas."
"Pet`` using the both ways and see the Swagger UI only render the example "
"once it's properly formatted (it ignores is otherwise)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../release-notes/changelog.rst:2937
