"will need to be defined with the same initialization signatures as "
"`QueueHandler <https://docs.python.org/3/library/logging.handlers."
"html#logging.handlers.QueueHandler>`_ and `QueueListener <https://docs."
"python.org/3/library/logging.handlers.html#logging.handlers.QueueListener>`_."
