#: ../../../release-notes/changelog.rst:3713
msgid ""
"Fix a bug where DTOs would raise a ``TypeError: __slots__ must be "
"identifiers`` during serialization, if a non-valid identifier (such as "
"``field-name``)was used for field renaming."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../release-notes/changelog.rst:3722
msgid ""
"Fix a regression introduced in ``2.0.0rc1`` that would cause data validated "
"by the DTO to be validated again by the signature model."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../release-notes/changelog.rst:3730
msgid ""
"Fix a regression introduced in ``2.4.0`` regarding the naming of OpenAPI "
"schema keys, in which a change was introduced to the way that keys for the "
"OpenAPI components/schemas objects were calculated to address the "
"possibility of name collisions."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../release-notes/changelog.rst:3735
msgid ""
"This behaviour was reverted for the case where a name has no collision, and "
"now only introduces extended keys for the case where there are multiple "
"objects with the same name, a case which would previously result in an "
"exception."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../release-notes/changelog.rst:3744
msgid ""
"Fix a regression introduced in ``2.4.3`` causing two routes registered with "
"the same path, but different methods to break OpenAPI schema generation due "
"to both of them having the same value for operation ID."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../release-notes/changelog.rst:3753
msgid ""
"Fix an issue that would lead to a :exc:`RecursionError` when including "
"nested models in the OpenAPI schema."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../release-notes/changelog.rst:3765
msgid ""
"Fix a bug where an incorrect OpenAPI schema was generated generated when any "
"``Literal | None``-union was present in an annotation."
