#: ../../../release-notes/changelog.rst:4819
msgid ""
"Fix a regression where calling :meth:`~litestar.dto.data_structures.DTOData."
"create_instance` would ignore the renaming settings of fields."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../release-notes/changelog.rst:4827
msgid ""
"Fix a regression that would set ``application/octet-stream`` as the "
"``contentEncoding`` instead of ``contentMediaType`` in the response schema "
"of :class:`~litestar.response.File` :class:`~litestar.response.Stream`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../release-notes/changelog.rst:4835
msgid ""
"Fix a regression that made the response schema use ``prefer_alias=True``, "
"diverging from how Pydantic models are exported by default."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../release-notes/changelog.rst:4842
msgid ""
"Fix a regression that made generated examples non-deterministic, caused by a "
"misconfiguration of the random seeding."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../release-notes/changelog.rst:4850
msgid ""
"Fix a bug where SQLAlchemy would raise a :exc:`TypeError` when using a "
"dialect that does not support JSON with the SQLAlchemy repositories."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../release-notes/changelog.rst:4857
msgid ""
"Fix a regression that would make ``litestar.contrib.jwt."
"JWTAuthenticationMiddleware`` authenticate ``OPTIONS`` and ``HEAD`` requests "
"by default."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../release-notes/changelog.rst:4865
