#: ../../../release-notes/changelog.rst:5218
msgid ""
"Fixes handling of columns defined with `Sequence <https://docs.sqlalchemy."
"org/en/20/core/defaults.html#defining-sequences>`_ default values."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../release-notes/changelog.rst:5222
msgid ""
"The SQLAlchemy default value for a :class:`~sqlalchemy.schema.Column` will "
"be ignored when it is a :class:`~sqlalchemy.schema.Sequence` object. This is "
"because the SQLAlchemy sequence types represent server generated values, and "
"there is no way for us to generate a reasonable default value for that field "
"from it without making a database query, which is not possible "
"deserialization."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../release-notes/changelog.rst:5232
msgid "Enables using redirect responses with a JSON media type."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../release-notes/changelog.rst:5238
msgid ""
"A bug was fixed that would lead to fields of a Pydantic model or msgspec "
"Structs being marked as \"not required\" in the generated OpenAPI schema "
"when used with DTOs."
