#: ../../../release-notes/changelog.rst:5568
msgid "it has a generic type argument that is supported by the dto"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../release-notes/changelog.rst:5569
msgid "the type argument maps to an attribute on the return type"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../release-notes/changelog.rst:5571
msgid ""
"the DTO operations will be performed on the data retrieved from that "
"attribute of the instance returned from the handler, and return the instance."
