#: ../../../release-notes/changelog.rst:5971
msgid ""
"A new ``lifespan`` argument has been added to :class:`~litestar.app."
"Litestar`, accepting an asynchronous context manager, wrapping the lifespan "
"of the application. It will be entered with the startup phase and exited on "
"shutdown, providing functionality equal to the ``on_startup`` and "
"``on_shutdown`` hooks."
