#: ../../../release-notes/changelog.rst:6270
msgid ""
"Support for DTOs has been added to :class:`WebSocketListener <litestar."
"handlers.WebsocketListener>` and :class:`WebSocketListener <litestar."
"handlers.websocket_listener>`. A ``dto`` and ``return_dto`` parameter has "
"been added, providing the same functionality as their route handler "
"counterparts."
