"class:`DTOInterface <litestar.dto.interface.DTOInterface>`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../release-notes/changelog.rst:6282
msgid ""
"If a handler defines a plugin supported type as either the ``data`` kwarg "
"type annotation, or as the return annotation for a handler function, and no "
"DTO has otherwise been resolved to handle the type, the protocol creates a "
"DTO implementation to represent that type which is then used to de-serialize "
"into, and serialize from instances of that supported type."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../release-notes/changelog.rst:6288
msgid ""
"The `Piccolo ORM <https://piccolo-orm.com/>`_ and `Tortoise ORM <https://"
"tortoise.github.io/>`_ plugins have been removed by this change, but will be "
"re-implemented using the new patterns in a future release leading up to the "
"2.0 release."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../release-notes/changelog.rst:6309
msgid ""
"Timestamps parsed as :class:`date <datetime.date>` with Pydantic return a "
"UTC date, while cattrs implementation return a date with the local timezone."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../release-notes/changelog.rst:6312
msgid "This was corrected by forcing dates to UTC when being parsed by attrs."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../release-notes/changelog.rst:6319
msgid ""
"An error would occur when using a callable without an :meth:`object."
"__init__` method was used in a placed that would cause it to be inspected "
"(such as a route handler's signature)."
