#: ../../../release-notes/changelog.rst:6371
msgid ""
"Prior to this, a DTO type could be declared implicitly using type "
"annotations. With the addition of the ``dto`` and ``return_dto`` parameters, "
"this feature has become superfluous and, in the spirit of offering only one "
"clear way of doing things, has been removed."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../release-notes/changelog.rst:6388
msgid ""
"The ``include`` parameter has been removed, to provide a more accessible "
"interface and avoid overly complex interplay with ``exclude`` and its "
"support for dotted attributes"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../release-notes/changelog.rst:6390
msgid ""
"``field_mapping`` has been renamed to ``rename_fields`` and support to remap "
