msgstr ""

#: ../../../release-notes/changelog.rst:6391
msgid ""
"experimental ``field_definitions`` has been removed. It may be replaced with "
"a \"ComputedField\" in a future release that will allow multiple field "
"definitions to be added to the model, and a callable that transforms them "
"into a value for a model field. See"
